menu "WiFi Dap system module (SYSTEM JSON module)"

    config BIRDIEBOT_ENABLE_CRASH_CMD
        bool "Enable the debug-only SYSTEM/DO_CRASH command (cmd 200)"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, the SYSTEM module accepts {"module":0,"cmd":200} and
            deliberately crashes the firmware (null-pointer dereference). It is
            a bring-up/debug helper only and is disabled by default in release
            builds (docs/protocol.md §2.1: DO_CRASH is only registered in debug
            builds).

endmenu
